">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>80%</td><td class='num'><b>55%</b></td><td class='num'>65</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>93%</td><td class='num'><b>63%</b></td><td class='num'>76</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>100%</td><td class='num'><b>77%</b></td><td class='num'>146</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">5 of 6 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Dhaka</b> <span class=\"muted\">BD</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Moderately skilful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">5 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.29</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>35&ndash;113\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 134</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>716 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Dhaka &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Dhaka\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"64.26404255319149,369.0921985815603 178.8862162162162,219.67567567567568 282.5232876712329,112.7397260273973 342.0713846153846,57.19999999999999 385.8692105263157,27.57894736842104 411.0786301369863,18.0 411.0786301369863,22.986301369863043 385.8692105263157,70.68421052631578 342.0713846153846,124.39999999999998 282.5232876712329,192.5205479452055 178.8862162162162,293.4594594594595 64.26404255319149,380.709219858156\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"257.4469273743017\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"257.4469273743017\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"64.26404255319149,379.41843971631204 178.8862162162162,298.3783783783784 282.5232876712329,237.39726027397262 342.0713846153846,180.39999999999998 385.8692105263157,152.10526315789474 411.0786301369863,100.27397260273972\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 2%&amp;#10;It rained 1% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 282 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"64.26404255319149\" cy=\"379.41843971631204\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 34%&amp;#10;It rained 23% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 74 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"178.8862162162162\" cy=\"298.3783783783784\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 63%&amp;#10;It rained 40% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 73 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"282.5232876712329\" cy=\"237.39726027397262\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 80%&amp;#10;It rained 55% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 65 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"342.0713846153846\" cy=\"180.39999999999998\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 93%&amp;#10;It rained 63% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 76 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"385.8692105263157\" cy=\"152.10526315789474\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 100%&amp;#10;It rained 77% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 146 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"411.0786301369863\" cy=\"100.27397260273972\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(34%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Dhaka the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.37) and least in\n<b>winter</b> (-1.19).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>174</td><td class='num'>1%</td><td class='num'>-1.190</td><td class='num'>2.6%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>162</td><td class='num'>69%</td><td class='num'>-0.098</td><td class='num'>18.4%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>208</td><td class='num'>33%</td><td class='num'>-0.014</td><td class='num'>21.7%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>172</td><td class='num'>37%</td><td class='num'>0.366</td><td class='num'>11.8%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":23.7104,"lon":90.40744,"n":716,"n_cities":134,"name":"Dhaka","offset_days":-1,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.18,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.01769503546099291,"n":282,"obs":0.0070921985815602835,"sig":false},{"hi":0.53,"lo":0.18,"mean":0.3414864864864865,"n":74,"ob